docs {
  Admin-only utility endpoints for connecting mr-twin-backend to Accurate
  Online. Unauthenticated for now (no backoffice/admin auth exists yet —
  see PLANNING.md Fase 2) — must be gated behind admin auth before any
  public deploy.

  Flow order: Connect (browser) → List Databases → Select Database →
  Connection Status.
}
